cff-version: 1.2.0

title: Speech Animation Framework

message: >
  If you use the Speech Animation Framework in your research,
  please cite this repository.

type: software

abstract: >
  An open-source framework for browser-based speech production and
  perception experiments using animated visual stimuli. The repository
  combines reusable experimental software, comprehensive methodological
  documentation, and example paradigms for designing, deploying, and
  analyzing cross-linguistic speech experiments.

authors:
  - family-names: Buza
    given-names: Ákos

version: 1.0.0

date-released: 2026-07-28

license: MIT

repository-code: https://github.com/akos-buza/speech-animation-experimental-framework

keywords:
  - speech production
  - speech perception
  - experimental phonetics
  - psycholinguistics
  - prosody
  - information structure
  - jsPsych
  - JATOS
  - browser experiments
  - linguistics
